# Notice

efishother is a static, local-first browser answer experiment. `another_brain`
is the engineering codename for the repository.

The public runtime is designed to run without backend inference, Vercel
Functions, Edge inference, external LLM APIs, Doubao, or a hosted vector store.

The committed R28M1 q4 browser model package and project source are distributed
under the MIT License. Training and corpus development used project-local
approved materials plus public-source/public-library style material summarized
by the repository documentation and manifests. Raw corpora, private material,
checkpoints, tokenizer training artifacts, and local training artifacts are not
distributed in this repository.

Third-party dependencies and source materials remain subject to their own
licenses and terms.
